{"version":1,"title":"[DB]SQL 简明教程 - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\">\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    \n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">文章</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb-link\" href=\"/categories/2026-2027-%E5%AD%B8%E5%B9%B4/\">2026 - 2027 學年</a> <span class=\"sep\"></span> <a class=\"cap breadcrumb-link\" href=\"/categories/2026-2027-%E5%AD%B8%E5%B9%B4/%E6%95%B8%E6%93%9A%E5%BA%AB%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/\">數據庫系統原理</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">2521 字 · 约 9 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-17T04:19:42.000Z\">2026-10-17</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-10-17T04:27:40.797Z\">2026-10-17</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>[DB]SQL 简明教程</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><h2 id=\"SQL-简明教程\">SQL 简明教程</h2>\n<h3 id=\"基础语法\">基础语法</h3>\n<h4 id=\"查询\">查询</h4>\n<p>以表 <code>student</code> 为例：</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>全表查询</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当我们使用 <code>select * from</code> 表名 这样的 SQL 语句时，就是在进行全表查询，它会返回数据表中的所有行，让我们可以全面了解表中的数据。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> <span class=\"operator\">*</span> <span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>选择查询</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选择查询的 SQL 语法是 SELECT {列名…}，它告诉数据库我们想要查看哪些列的数据。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, age <span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>别名</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在 SQL 查询中，我们可以使用别名语法 {原始字段名} as {别名} 来为查询结果的列名取一个便于理解的名称。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name <span class=\"keyword\">AS</span> 学生姓名, age <span class=\"keyword\">AS</span> 学生年龄 </span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>常量和运算</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在 SQL 查询中，常量指的是固定的数值或文本（比如 “1”），而运算则是对这些常量进行数学运算或字符串操作。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, score, score <span class=\"operator\">*</span> <span class=\"number\">2</span> <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> double_score</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"条件查询\">条件查询</h4>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>WHERE</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>WHERE</code> 子句的语法如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">SELECT</span> 列<span class=\"number\">1</span>, 列<span class=\"number\">2</span>, ...</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">FROM</span> 表名</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">WHERE</span> 条件;</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>例如我们要从名为 <code>student</code> 的表中选出名字为「伊泽海」的学生的<strong>姓名</strong>和<strong>成绩</strong>，可以写成：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, score</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">WHERE</span> name <span class=\"operator\">=</span> <span class=\"string\">'伊泽海'</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>运算符</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>运算符是 SQL 中用于在条件查询中进行条件判断的特殊符号，比如 <code>=</code>、 <code>!=</code>、<code>&lt;</code>、<code>&gt;</code> 等。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, age</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">where</span> name <span class=\"operator\">!=</span> <span class=\"string\">'伊泽海'</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>空值</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>空值表示该字段的值是未知的、不存在的或者没有被填写的。在SQL查询中，我们可以使用 “IS NULL” 和 “IS NOT NULL” 来判断字段是否为空值或非空值。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, age, score</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">where</span> age <span class=\"keyword\">IS</span> <span class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>模糊查询</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在 LIKE 模糊查询中，我们使用通配符来代表零个或多个字符，从而能够快速地找到匹配的数据。</p>\n<p>有如下 2 种通配符：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>%</code>：表示<strong>任意长度</strong>的任意字符序列</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>_</code>：表示任意<strong>单个</strong>字符</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>同理，可以使用 NOT LIKE 来查询不包含某关键字的信息。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, score</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">where</span> name <span class=\"keyword\">NOT</span> <span class=\"keyword\">LIKE</span> <span class=\"string\">'%伊%'</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>逻辑运算</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>常用逻辑运算有：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>AND</code>：逻辑与</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>OR</code>：逻辑或</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>NOT</code>：逻辑非</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, score</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">where</span> name <span class=\"keyword\">LIKE</span> <span class=\"string\">'%伊%'</span> <span class=\"keyword\">OR</span> score <span class=\"operator\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"number\">500</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"去重\">去重</h4>\n<p>在 SQL 中，我们可以使用 DISTINCT 关键字来实现去重操作。DISTINCT 还支持根据多个字段的组合来去重，<strong>保持多个字段的组合是唯一的</strong>。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> <span class=\"keyword\">DISTINCT</span> class_id, exam_num</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"排序\">排序</h4>\n<p>在 SQL 中，我们可以使用 ORDER BY 关键字来实现排序操作。ORDER BY 后面跟上需要排序的字段，可以选择升序（ASC）或降序（DESC）排列。</p>\n<p>在排序的基础上，我们还可以根据多个字段的值进行排序。当第一个字段的值相同时，再按照第二个字段的值进行排序，以此类推。例如：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">ORDER</span> <span class=\"keyword\">BY</span> 字段<span class=\"number\">1</span> [升序<span class=\"operator\">/</span>降序], 字段<span class=\"number\">2</span> [升序<span class=\"operator\">/</span>降序], ...</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, age, score</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">ORDER</span> <span class=\"keyword\">BY</span> score <span class=\"keyword\">DESC</span>, age <span class=\"keyword\">ASC</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"截断和偏移\">截断和偏移</h4>\n<p>在 SQL 中，我们使用 LIMIT 关键字来实现数据的截断和偏移。</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>截断：<code>LIMIT &lt;数字&gt;</code>，表示从头开始，一次获取&lt;数字&gt;条数据</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>偏移：<code>LIMIT &lt;数字 1&gt;, &lt;数字 2&gt;</code>，表示从<strong>下标</strong>&lt;数字 1&gt;开始，获取&lt;数字 2&gt;条数据</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, age</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">order</span> <span class=\"keyword\">by</span> age <span class=\"keyword\">ASC</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">LIMIT <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"条件分支\">条件分支</h4>\n<p>使用 CASE WHEN 可以在查询结果中根据特定的条件动态生成新的列或对现有的列进行转换。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">CASE</span> <span class=\"keyword\">WHEN</span> (条件<span class=\"number\">1</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">THEN</span> 结果<span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">WHEN</span> (条件<span class=\"number\">2</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">THEN</span> 结果<span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ...</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">ELSE</span> 其他结果 <span class=\"keyword\">END</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">CASE</span> <span class=\"keyword\">WHEN</span> (age <span class=\"operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"number\">60</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">THEN</span> <span class=\"string\">'老同学'</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">WHEN</span> (age <span class=\"operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"number\">20</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> age <span class=\"operator\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\"number\">60</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">THEN</span> <span class=\"string\">'年轻'</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">ELSE</span> <span class=\"string\">'小同学'</span> <span class=\"keyword\">END</span> <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> age_level</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">order</span> <span class=\"keyword\">by</span> name <span class=\"keyword\">ASC</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"函数\">函数</h3>\n<h4 id=\"时间函数\">时间函数</h4>\n<p>常用时间函数：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>DATE()</code>：获取当前日期</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>DATETIME()</code>：获取当前日期时间</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>TIME()</code>：获取当前时间</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, <span class=\"type\">DATE</span>() <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> 当前日期</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"字符串处理\">字符串处理</h4>\n<p>常用字符串函数：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>UPPER()</code>：转大写</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>LOWER()</code>：转小写</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>LENGTH()</code>：计算字符串长度</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> id, name, <span class=\"built_in\">UPPER</span>(name) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> upper_name</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">where</span> name <span class=\"operator\">=</span> <span class=\"string\">'Izawami'</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"库函数聚合函数\"><ruby>库函数<rt>聚合函数</rt></ruby></h4>\n<p>常用库函数：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>COUNT()</code>：计算指定列的行数或者非空值的数量</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>SUM()</code>：计算指定列的数值之和</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>AVG()</code>：计算指定列的数值平均值</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>MAX()</code>：找出指定列的最大值</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>MIN()</code>：找出指定列的最小值</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">SUM</span>(score) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> total_score,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">AVG</span>(score) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> avg_score,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">MAX</span>(score) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> max_score,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">MIN</span>(score) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> min_score</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"分组\">分组</h3>\n<h4 id=\"单字段分组\">单字段分组</h4>\n<p>分组允许我们按照指定的列或字段对数据进行分组，然后对每个分组应用聚合函数，如 COUNT、SUM、AVG 等，以获得分组后的汇总结果。通常使用 GROUP BY 关键字进行分组。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> class_id, <span class=\"built_in\">AVG</span>(score) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> avg_score</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">GROUP</span> <span class=\"keyword\">BY</span> class_id</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"多字段分组\">多字段分组</h4>\n<p>多字段分组和单字段分组的实现方式几乎一致，使用 GROUP BY 语法即可。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> class_id, exam_num, <span class=\"built_in\">COUNT</span>(<span class=\"operator\">*</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> total_num</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">GROUP</span> <span class=\"keyword\">BY</span> class_id, exam_num</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"HAVING\"><code>HAVING</code></h4>\n<p>在 SQL 中，HAVING 子句用于在分组聚合后对分组进行过滤。它允许我们对分组后的结果进行条件筛选，只保留满足特定条件的分组。</p>\n<p>HAVING 子句与条件查询 WHERE 子句的区别在于，WHERE 子句用于在 分组之前 进行过滤，而 HAVING 子句用于在 分组之后 进行过滤。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> class_id, <span class=\"built_in\">SUM</span>(score) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> total_score</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">group</span> <span class=\"keyword\">by</span> class_id</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">HAVING</span> <span class=\"built_in\">SUM</span>(score) <span class=\"operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"number\">150</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"查询进阶\">查询进阶</h3>\n<h4 id=\"连表查询\">连表查询</h4>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>CROSS JOIN</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CROSS JOIN 是一种简单的关联查询，不需要任何条件来匹配行，它直接将左表的 每一行 与右表的 每一行 进行组合，返回的结果是两个表的笛卡尔积。</p>\n<p>例如有 A，B 两张表：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> A.attr1, B.attr2</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> A</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">CROSS</span> <span class=\"keyword\">JOIN</span> B</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>等价于：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> A.attr1, B.attr2</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> A, B</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>通过逗号分隔表名，隐式实现笛卡尔积。</p>\n<p>在多表关联查询的 SQL 中，我们最好在选择字段时指定字段所属表的名称（比如 <code>A.attr1</code>）。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    student.name <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> student_name,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    student.age <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> student_age,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    student.class_id <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> class_id,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    class.name <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> class_name</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">CROSS</span> <span class=\"keyword\">JOIN</span> class</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>INNER JOIN</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>INNER JOIN 是一种常见的关联查询方式，它根据两个表之间的关联条件，将满足条件的行组合在一起。</p>\n<p>注意，INNER JOIN 只返回两个表中满足关联条件的交集部分，即在两个表中都存在的匹配行。</p>\n<p>INNER JOIN 的语法是：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"operator\">&lt;</span>表 A<span class=\"operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">JOIN</span> <span class=\"operator\">&lt;</span>表 B<span class=\"operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">ON</span> <span class=\"operator\">&lt;</span>条件<span class=\"operator\">&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    student.name <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> student_name,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    student.age <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> student_age,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    student.class_id <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> class_id,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    class.name <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> class_name,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    class.level <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> class_level</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">JOIN</span> class <span class=\"keyword\">ON</span> student.class_id <span class=\"operator\">=</span> class.id</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>OUTER JOIN</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>OUTER JOIN 是一种关联查询方式，它根据指定的关联条件，将两个表中满足条件的行组合在一起，并 <strong>包含没有匹配的行</strong>。</p>\n<p>在 OUTER JOIN 中，包括 LEFT OUTER JOIN 和 RIGHT OUTER JOIN 两种类型，它们分别表示查询左表和右表的所有行（即使没有被匹配），再加上满足条件的交集部分。</p>\n<p>一般来说我们只会用到 LEFT OUTER JOIN，因为部分 DBMS 不支持 RIGHT OUTER JOIN。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    student.name <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> student_name,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    student.age <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> student_age,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    student.class_id <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> class_id,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    class.name <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> class_name,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    class.level <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> class_level</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">LEFT</span> <span class=\"keyword\">JOIN</span> class <span class=\"keyword\">ON</span> student.class_id <span class=\"operator\">=</span> class.id</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"子查询\">子查询</h4>\n<p>子查询是指在一个查询语句内部<strong>嵌套</strong> 另一个完整的查询语句，内层查询被称为子查询。子查询可以用于获取更复杂的查询结果或者用于过滤数据。</p>\n<p>当执行包含子查询的查询语句时，数据库引擎会<strong>首先执行子查询</strong>，然后将其结果作为条件或数据源来执行外层查询。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, score, class_id</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">where</span> class_id <span class=\"keyword\">IN</span> (</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">select</span> id</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">from</span> class</span><br><span class=\"line\">)</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>EXISTS</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>子查询中的一种特殊类型是 EXISTS 子查询，用于检查主查询的结果集是否存在满足条件的记录，它返回布尔值（True 或 False），而不返回实际的数据。</p>\n<p>相应的，我们可以用 NOT EXISTS 来查找不满足存在条件的记录。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, age, class_id</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">where</span> <span class=\"keyword\">NOT</span> <span class=\"keyword\">EXISTS</span> (</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">select</span> <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">from</span> class</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">where</span> class.id <span class=\"operator\">=</span> student.class_id</span><br><span class=\"line\">)</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"组合查询\">组合查询</h4>\n<p>常用组合查询：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>UNION</code>：它用于将两个或多个查询的结果集合并，<strong>并去除重复的行</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>UNION ALL</code>：它也用于将两个或多个查询的结果集合并，<strong>但不去除重复的行</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, age, score, class_id</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">UNION</span> <span class=\"keyword\">ALL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> name, age, score, class_id</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student_new</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"开窗函数\">开窗函数</h4>\n<p>开窗函数是一种强大的查询工具，它允许我们在查询中进行对分组数据进行计算、<strong>同时保留原始行的详细信息</strong>。</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>OVER PARTITION BY</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以 SUM 为参照，如果表 SC 有以下数据：</p>\n<div class=\"md-table-scroll\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Sno</th>\n<th>Cno</th>\n<th>Grade</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>001</td>\n<td>C1</td>\n<td>90</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>001</td>\n<td>C2</td>\n<td>85</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>002</td>\n<td>C1</td>\n<td>78</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>003</td>\n<td>C2</td>\n<td>88</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>003</td>\n<td>C3</td>\n<td>92</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>对整个表求和：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> <span class=\"built_in\">SUM</span>(Grade)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> SC</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>得到：</p>\n<div class=\"md-table-scroll\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SUM(Grade)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>433</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>或者用 GROUP BY 分组求和：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span> Sno, <span class=\"built_in\">SUM</span>(Grade) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> total</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> SC</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">group</span> <span class=\"keyword\">by</span> Sno</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>得到按学号分组的成绩和：</p>\n<div class=\"md-table-scroll\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Sno</th>\n<th>Total</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>001</td>\n<td>175</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>002</td>\n<td>78</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>003</td>\n<td>180</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>我们会发现行数减少了，因为分组后每一个学生只对应一行汇总结果。</p>\n<p>如果我们希望保留原来行数，就需要用到开窗函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    Sno,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    Cno,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    Grade,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">SUM</span>(Grade) <span class=\"keyword\">OVER</span> (</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">PARTITION</span> <span class=\"keyword\">BY</span> Sno</span><br><span class=\"line\">) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> total</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> SC</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>得到：</p>\n<div class=\"md-table-scroll\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Sno</th>\n<th>Cno</th>\n<th>Grade</th>\n<th>Total</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>001</td>\n<td>C1</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>175</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>001</td>\n<td>C2</td>\n<td>85</td>\n<td>175</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>002</td>\n<td>C1</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>78</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>003</td>\n<td>C2</td>\n<td>88</td>\n<td>180</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>003</td>\n<td>C3</td>\n<td>92</td>\n<td>180</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight sql\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">select</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"operator\">*</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">AVG</span>(score) <span class=\"keyword\">OVER</span> (</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">PARTITION</span> <span class=\"keyword\">BY</span> class_id</span><br><span class=\"line\">) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> class_avg_score</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> student</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n</article>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"content","layout":"post","type":"tech","textIndent":false}